octeon-flowtable — nftables flow offload for Cavium Octeon (CN50xx / CN61xx)

License: GPL-2.0
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0

This package is a Linux kernel module and is licensed under GPL-2.0,
consistent with the Linux kernel and with the upstream project:

  https://github.com/packerlschupfer/octeon-flowtable

That project is a clean-room reimplementation for Octeon+ (CN50xx /
EdgeRouter Lite 3). This tree ports it for CN6120 (USG-PRO-4) OpenWrt.

Device/board support for the USG-PRO-4 in this OpenWrt tree is based on:

  https://codeberg.org/Shiz/openwrt

No Ubiquiti binary modules and no Cavium SDK code are included.
OpenWrt itself remains GPL-2.0-only (see the repository root COPYING).
